<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/forestInventoryTypeValue/protectiveFunction> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Forest with protective function, especially against natural hazards and detrimental environmental impacts, as well as endangered of eroding forces of wind, water or gravity."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/forestInventoryTypeValue:1> .
