<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/sbgLandUseValue/BALK> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ländliche Kerngebiete"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/sbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/sbgLandUseValue/BALK> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "INSPIRE governance level: national-technical"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/sbgLandUseValue:1> .
