<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/sbgLandUseValue/BARW> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/lu> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/sbgLandUseValue:1> .
