<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/applicationschema/nz> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/nz> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Areas whose present state has to be preserved in order to ensure the protective function also in the future (e.g. natural diversion dams, flood retarding areas in the form of terrain synclines) are identified as purple reference areas."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Gebiete, deren gegenwärtiger Zustand erhalten werden muss, um die Schutzfunktion auch in Zukunft zu gewährleisten (z.B. natürliche Umleitungsdämme, hochwasserrückhaltende Flächen in Form von Geländemulden), werden als violette Hinweisbereiche ausgewiesen."@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "purpleReferenceArea" <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "purple reference area"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Violetter Hinweisbereich"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/purpleReferenceArea> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "INSPIRE governance level: national-technical"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
