<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/applicationschema/nz> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/nz> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In den roten Gefahrenzonen ist die Bedrohung durch Lawinen/sturzflutartiges Hochwasser so hoch, dass eine dauerhafte Besiedlung nicht oder nur mit unverhältnismäßig hohem Aufwand möglich ist. Der Bau neuer Gebäude wird nicht empfohlen."@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In red hazard zones the threat due to snow avalanches /torrential floods is so high that permanent settlement is not possible or only possible with a disproportionately high expenditure. The construction of new buildings is not recommended."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "redHazardZone" <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "red hazard zone"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Rote Gefahrenzone"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "INSPIRE governance level: national-technical"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/redHazardZone> <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/registry/status/valid> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/applicationschema/nz> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/nz> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A torrential catchment area comprises the area of the torrent, its tributaries and its alluvial fan. Torrents are perennial or partially active waters. They are characterized by sediment transport, debris flows and woody debris."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ein Wildbach (im Sinne des § 99 Abs. 1 ForstG) ist ein dauernd oder zeitweise fließendes Gewässer, das durch rasch eintretende und nur kurze Zeit dauernde Anschwellungen Feststoffe aus seinem Einzugsgebiet oder aus seinem Bachbett in gefahrdrohendem Ausmaße entnimmt, diese mit sich führt und innerhalb oder außerhalb seines Bettes ablagert oder einem anderen Gewässer zuführt. Das Einzugsgebiet eines Wildbaches (im Sinne des § 99 Abs. 3 ForstG) ist die Fläche des von diesem und seinen Zuflüssen entwässerten Niederschlagsgebietes sowie der Ablagerungsbereich des Wildbaches."@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "torrentCatchmentAreas" <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "torrent catchment areas"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Wildbach-Einzugsgebiet"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "INSPIRE governance level: national-technical"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/torrentCatchmentAreas> <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/registry/status/valid> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/yellowHazardZone> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/applicationschema/nz> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV/yellowHazardZone> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/nz> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/specificExposedElementTypeWLV:1> .
