<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/SpecificHazardTypeValue/blindtromben> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In meteorology, a cloud column or inverted cloud cone, pendant from a cloud base. This supplementary feature occurs mostly with cumulus and cumulonimbus; when it reaches the earth's surface it constitutes the cloudy manifestation of an intense vortex, namely, a tornado or waterspout."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/SpecificHazardTypeValue:1> .
