<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/BB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Baufläche-Betriebsgebiet"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/BB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "building zone - operating area"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/BB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "INSPIRE governance level: national-technical"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/BB> <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/registry/status/valid> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
