<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/BEB-I> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "future development zone - category I operating area"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
