<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Waldfläche"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FG> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "INSPIRE governance level: national-technical"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FG> <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/registry/status/valid> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/applicationschema/lunom> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Def. VBG"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Def. VBG"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/lu> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/F> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In agricultural areas, the construction of buildings and facilities is permitted, as far as it is necessary in terms of the soil-dependent agricultural and silvicultural use, including the associated, necessary residential spaces and residential buildings and for the subsidiary occupation of agriculture and silviculture as well as the domestic external activity."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "In Landwirtschaftsgebieten ist die Errichtung von Gebäuden und Anlagen zulässig, soweit dies für die bodenabhängige land- und forstwirtschaftliche Nutzung einschließlich der dazu gehörenden erforderlichen Wohnräume und Wohngebäude und für Nebengewerbe der Land-und Forstwirtschaft sowie die häusliche Nebenbeschäftigung notwendig ist."@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FL" <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Freifläche-Landwirtschaftsgebiet"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "open space - agricultural area"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "INSPIRE governance level: national-technical"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FL> <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/registry/status/valid> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/applicationschema/lunom> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Def. VBG"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Def. VBG"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/lu> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/F> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Als Sondergebiete können Flächen festgelegt werden, auf denen Gebäude und Anlagen errichtet werden dürfen, die ihrer Zweckwidmung nach an einen bestimmten Standort gebunden sind oder sich an einem bestimmten Standort besonders eignen, wie z.B. Flächen für Kleingärten, gewerbliche Gärtnereien, Kinderspielplätze, Erholungs-und Sportanlagen, Campingplätze, Ausflugsgasthöfe, Schutzhütten, Steinbrüche, Kiesgruben, Anlagen zur Fassung von Quell-sowie zur Entnahme von Grundwasser, Schießstätten und Sprengmittellager. Der vorgesehene Verwendungszweck ist in der Widmung anzuführen."@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Zones can be determined as exceptional areas, on which buildings and facilities can be errected, that are tied to a specific location or are highly suited for a specific location, as e.g. areas for allotments, commercial gardening, playgrounds, recreational- and sports facilities, camping grounds, excurison inns, refuges, stone quarries, gravel pits, facilities to load spring water as well as the extraction of ground water, shooting ranges and explosive storage depots. The intended use has to be cited in the zoning."@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue> <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "FS" <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Freifläche-Sondergebiet"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "open space - exceptional area"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/FS> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "INSPIRE governance level: national-technical"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
