<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/VB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "traffic area - railway"@en <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
<https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue/VB> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Verkehrsfläche Bahn"@de <https://registry.inspire.gv.at/codelist/vbgLandUseValue:1> .
